  "notes": "Carrier-borne strike fighter. A pulse laser for the knife fight and a missile rack with ninety-six rounds for everything else, one on each of its two firmpoints, behind as much crystaliron as a 40-ton hull will take. No bunk: the pilot lives aboard the carrier. Refitted: a dual cockpit seats a gunner, the cargo space carries fragmentation, decoy and long-range missiles, and enhanced stealth hides the hull.",
